summary: Verify leftover background processes do not block test execution
description: |
    A test which starts a background process holding its output
    open, and exits without stopping it, must not block tmt until
    the test duration runs out. The test exit code and output must
    be kept, and the leftover process reported in the test output.
duration: 15m
tag+:
  - provision-container
  - provision-virtual
